{"type": "entity", "id": "brand-identity#1.1", "hash": "2fcb6e49", "kind": "values", "subject": "expression-motion", "origin": "## Brand Identity", "lines": [8, 8], "text": "- `0.0-0.2`: static, grid-locked, zero animation, dense"}
{"type": "entity", "id": "brand-identity#2.1", "hash": "afb8afef", "kind": "values", "subject": "expression-motion", "origin": "## Brand Identity", "lines": [18, 20], "text": "| Surface | Expression | What it permits |\n|---|---|---|\n| cli, human TTY | 0.2 | Static k9s-style fixed-column rows and one static context header. Colour is only a second cue: amber `DIALOG` and dim `stale`, always beside the word. Nothing redraws in place and there are no spinners. |"}
{"type": "entity", "id": "brand-identity#2.2", "hash": "dcadf4d2", "kind": "values", "subject": "expression-motion", "origin": "## Brand Identity", "lines": [21, 21], "text": "| cli, `--json` / non-TTY / `NO_COLOR` / `TERM=dumb` / `viola run` passthrough | 0.0 | No colour, no glyphs, no cursor control, no spinner. `viola run` prints nothing at all while the wrapped `claude` TUI runs, and neither does a `viola revive` that passed its preflight. |"}
